"注释密度适中（%1$@）" = "Comment density is moderate (%1$@)";
"为公共 API 与复杂分支补充说明性注释" = "Add explanatory comments to public APIs and complex branches";
"当前无明显短板：在场维度都落在可接受区间，综合分只由这些分量按权重算出，没有额外加分项。" = "No obvious weak spot: every present dimension sits in the acceptable range, and the overall score is only these components weighted - nothing earns a bonus.";
"本次所有参与计分的维度都属于代码口径，因此它与综合分同源同值。" = "Every scored dimension in this run belongs to the code basis, so it shares the overall score's source and value.";
"代码口径只统计靠改本仓库代码就能抬起来的维度；已排除 %1$@——它们量的是提交历史的节奏与署名分布、第三方依赖与运行日志，不是这份代码本身的好坏。" = "The code basis counts only the dimensions a change in this repository can lift; excluded %1$@ - they measure commit cadence and authorship, third-party dependencies and runtime logs, not the quality of this code.";
"先在侧栏「添加项目」选择本地仓库目录，或点右上角「重新分析」采集指标。" = "Use \"Add Project\" in the sidebar to pick a local repository, or \"Re-analyse\" in the top-right to collect metrics.";
"尚无可用指标" = "No metrics available yet";
"尚无可用指标，无法给出健康评分；选择项目目录后会自动完成采集。" = "No metrics are available, so no health score can be given; selecting a project directory collects them automatically.";
"已采集到输入，但%1$@各维度都缺少可计分证据，本次不给出综合分，避免把没测到当成好结果。" = "Inputs were collected, but every dimension among %1$@ lacks scoreable evidence, so no overall score is given this run - never read \"not measured\" as a good result.";

// 批次 P59b（协作分布与活跃度的建议/缺席句）：整句键，测得值一律走位置参数。
"提交节奏稳定（日均 %1$@ 次；这个频率只在曲线里折算一次，本句不另加分）" = "Cadence is steady (%1$@ commits per day; the curve already folds this rate in once, so this line adds no credit)";
"提交历史仅 %1$@ 天，样本不足，活跃度不宣称节奏、按 %2$@ 分封顶；跑满一周后重扫即可解锁。" = "History spans only %1$@ days, too small a sample: cadence is not claimed and activity is capped at %2$@. Rescan after a full week to unlock it.";
"提交历史缺可用的首末时间，日均无法计算，活跃度按曲线最低档计，等重新分析补齐两端再评。" = "The history has no usable first/last commit time, so a daily average cannot be computed; activity scores at the curve's floor until a re-analysis fills both ends.";
"已 %1$@ 天无提交" = "%1$@ days without commits";
"作者表里没有可算分布的提交（非合并口径 0 笔，含合并共 %1$@ 笔），协作分布不参与本次计分；这一维读的是「署名分布」，要有非合并提交才谈得上分散与否。" = "The author table holds no commits to distribute (0 non-merge out of %1$@ including merges), so collaboration does not take part in this score; that dimension reads signature spread, which needs non-merge commits to mean anything.";
"作者分布的总体只有 %1$@ 笔非合并提交、%2$@ 个活跃署名 —— 一笔提交就折合 %3$@ 占比，跨一个档位只要一两笔 ⇒ 占比无定义，协作分布不参与本次计分（也不按 0 计入）；非合并提交攒到 %4$@ 笔以上重扫即可解锁。" = "The author population is only %1$@ non-merge commits across %2$@ active signatures - one commit moves the share by %3$@ and one or two cross a band, so the share is undefined; collaboration does not take part in this score (nor is it counted as 0). Rescan once %4$@ non-merge commits have accumulated.";
"非合并口径 %1$@ 笔、%2$@ 个活跃署名，低于评这一维所需的 %3$@ 笔总体 —— 一笔提交折合 %4$@ 占比，占比无定义，本维度不参与计分（也不按 0 计入）。" = "%1$@ non-merge commits across %2$@ active signatures, below the %3$@-commit population this dimension needs - one commit moves the share by %4$@, so the share is undefined and the dimension is not scored (nor counted as 0).";

// 批次 P59c（健康评分：权重 tooltip、缺席原因、分析器名）。
"该维度不在内置权重表里，直接采用评分器给出的权重 %1$@。" = "This dimension is not in the built-in weight table, so the scorer's own weight %1$@ is used directly.";
"本次乘数 %1$@，与内置表原始权重 %2$@ 一致。" = "This run's multiplier %1$@ matches the table's original weight %2$@.";
"内置权重表合计 %1$@，评分器发布前整体折算：原始 %2$@ → 本次乘数 %3$@。本次没有维度缺席。" = "The built-in weight table sums to %1$@ and was normalised before publishing: original %2$@ -> this run %3$@. No dimension was absent.";
"%1$@ 个维度缺席，份额按在场维度等比摊入：原始 %2$@ → 本次乘数 %3$@（在场维度表权重合计 %4$@，全表合计 %5$@）。" = "%1$@ dimensions were absent and their share was spread proportionally over the present ones: original %2$@ -> this run %3$@ (present dimensions sum to %4$@ in the table, the whole table to %5$@).";
"本次乘数 %1$@ 与内置表口径（原始 %2$@、表合计 %3$@、缺席 %4$@ 项）对不上，界面以评分器发布值为准。" = "This run's multiplier %1$@ does not reconcile with the table basis (original %2$@, table sum %3$@, %4$@ absent); the interface shows the scorer's published value.";
"输入覆盖全部 %1$@ 个可计分维度，没有维度缺席；但内置权重表合计 %2$@，评分器发布前已整体折算，故各乘数不等于表内原始值。" = "The inputs cover all %1$@ scoreable dimensions with none absent; the built-in table sums to %2$@ and was normalised before publishing, so each multiplier differs from the table's original value.";
"输入覆盖全部 %1$@ 个可计分维度，没有维度缺席；权重未做摊分，乘数即表内原始值。" = "The inputs cover all %1$@ scoreable dimensions with none absent; nothing was re-spread, so each multiplier is the table's original value.";
"缺失 %1$@ 个维度不参与计分、也不按 0 计入，其份额已按在场维度等比摊入。" = "The %1$@ missing dimensions are not scored and are not counted as 0; their share was spread proportionally over the present dimensions.";
"本次实际乘数：在场维度的乘数合计恒为 100%，故 Σ（得分 × 乘数）可复现综合分。与内置表原始值不一致的原因见各行提示。" = "Multipliers actually used: the present dimensions always sum to 100%, so the score-weighted sum reproduces the overall score. Each row's tooltip explains any difference from the table's original value.";
"该维度不在内置口径里，本次未参与计分。" = "This dimension is not part of the built-in basis and did not take part in this score.";
"「%1$@」完成但该分量未产出。" = "%1$@ finished but did not produce this component.";
"上次扫描「%1$@」失败，本维度没有输入。" = "The last %1$@ scan failed, so this dimension has no input.";
"还没有扫描结果，「%1$@」未运行。" = "There is no scan result yet; %1$@ never ran.";
"「%1$@」没有产出代码指标。" = "%1$@ produced no code metrics.";
"该目录不是 Git 仓库，或未取到提交历史。" = "This directory is not a Git repository, or its commit history could not be read.";
"该仓库没有任何提交，Git 两维都没有输入。" = "The repository has no commits, so neither Git-based dimension has an input.";
"含合并共 %1$@ 笔提交里没有一笔非合并提交，作者分布没有可算的总体，本维度不参与计分。" = "None of the %1$@ commits (merges included) is a non-merge commit, so the author distribution has no population to measure and this dimension is not scored.";
"尚未分析日志。" = "Logs have not been analysed yet.";
"未发现可读的日志文件。" = "No readable log files were found.";
"未识别到依赖清单。" = "No dependency manifest was recognised.";
"扫到 %1$@ 个覆盖率报告文件，但里面没有可用的行覆盖数字，不参与计分。" = "%1$@ coverage report files were found, but none carries usable line-coverage numbers, so this dimension is not scored.";
"%1$@%2$@上面的结论只覆盖看得见的部分。" = "%1$@%2$@ The conclusion above covers only the part that was visible.";
"%1$@另有 %2$@ 个目录没能读取（权限或已消失），上面的结论只覆盖读得动的部分。" = "%1$@ Another %2$@ directories could not be read (permissions, or they are gone), so the conclusion above covers only what was readable.";
"代码扫描" = "Code analysis";
"Git 分析" = "Git analysis";

// 批次 P59d（运行稳定性 / 依赖健康 / 覆盖率那三路的建议与缺席句）。
"证据不足：%1$@" = "Insufficient evidence: %1$@";
"未采集运行时长与请求量，分母只是已扫描的日志行" = "Runtime duration and request volume are not collected, so the denominator is only the log lines scanned";
"另有 %1$@ 份崩溃通道文件未产出可用事件证据（内容损坏 / 无可用事件时间 / 只有文件名像），未计入崩溃数" = "A further %1$@ crash-channel files produced no usable event evidence (corrupt, no usable event time, or only the filename looks like one); they are not counted as crashes";
"已扫描 %1$@ 行日志，窗口内未见确认崩溃（不等于运行期无崩溃：未采运行时长与请求量）" = "Scanned %1$@ log lines with no confirmed crash in the window (this is not \"no crashes at runtime\": duration and request volume are not collected)";
"%1$@出现 %2$@ 次（最近 %3$@）" = "%1$@ occurred %2$@ times (last seen %3$@)";
"优先修复 Top Errors 首位，它通常掩盖了下游连锁异常" = "Fix the top error first; it usually masks downstream cascades";
"没有可扫描的日志，运行稳定性不参与本次评分；把日志文件放进项目目录或 ~/Library/Logs，或在「错误日志」页点「附加日志」，这个维度才会出现。" = "There are no logs to scan, so runtime stability is not scored this run. Put log files in the project directory or ~/Library/Logs, or use \\\"Attach Log Files\\\" on the Error Logs page, for this dimension to appear.";
"读到 %1$@ 次确认崩溃%2$@，但零真日志行 ⇒ 错误密度算不出分母，本维度不参与本次评分；崩溃明细见「错误日志」页。" = "Read %1$@ confirmed crashes%2$@ but zero real log lines, so error density has no denominator and this dimension is not scored; see the Error Logs page for the details.";
"（%1$@ 份崩溃报告）" = "(%1$@ crash reports)";
"（崩溃通道零份，来自日志行本身）" = "(no crash-channel files; taken from the log lines themselves)";
"有 %1$@ 份崩溃报告没能读出来（权限不足 / 文件已消失 / 读取失败），崩溃证据不确定：本维度不参与本次评分，也不得读成「没有崩溃」。" = "%1$@ crash reports could not be read (permissions, gone, or read failure), so the crash evidence is uncertain: this dimension is not scored and must not be read as \\\"no crashes\\\".";
"另有 %1$@ 份崩溃报告没能读出来，未计入上面的份数。" = "A further %1$@ crash reports could not be read and are not included in the count above.";
"只读到 %1$@ 行真日志，低于评这一维所需的 %2$@ 行下限 ⇒ 证据太薄，本维度按 %3$@ 分封顶、标「证据太薄·未判定」（薄不等于稳，也不等于运行不稳）；跑够一次真实运行后重扫即可解锁。" = "Only %1$@ real log lines were read, below the %2$@-line floor this dimension needs: the evidence is thin, so it is capped at %3$@ and marked \\\"thin evidence, undetermined\\\" (thin is neither stable nor unstable). Rescan after one real run to unlock it.";
"漏洞核对未完成（%1$@），依赖健康本维度暂不计分；补齐锁文件或重跑联网核对后再计。" = "The vulnerability check is incomplete (%1$@), so dependency health is not scored yet; add the lock files or re-run the online check.";
"存在未覆盖项" = "uncovered items exist";
"未做在线漏洞核对，依赖健康本维度暂不计分；开启「联网核对」后重扫才有结论。" = "No online vulnerability check was made, so dependency health is not scored; enable the online check and rescan for a conclusion.";
"未做在线漏洞核对，依赖健康本维度暂不计分（内置规则未覆盖：%1$@）。" = "No online vulnerability check was made, so dependency health is not scored (built-in rules do not cover: %1$@).";
"已完成漏洞核对，%1$@/%2$@ 个依赖零命中%3$@" = "Vulnerability check complete: zero hits across %1$@/%2$@ dependencies%3$@";
"（数据源：%1$@）" = "(source: %1$@)";
"%1$@ 个已知漏洞，%2$@ 个版本过旧" = "%1$@ known vulnerabilities, %2$@ outdated versions";
"先升级带严重漏洞的依赖，再统一处理过期版本" = "Upgrade dependencies with critical vulnerabilities first, then handle stale versions";
"测试覆盖率 %1$@" = "Test coverage %1$@";
"将行覆盖率从 %1$@ 提升到 75%% 以上" = "Raise line coverage from %1$@ to above 75%%";
"行覆盖 %1$@，分支覆盖 %2$@" = "Lines %1$@, branches %2$@";
"无数据" = "no data";
"列到 %1$@ 个日志文件，但一行都没读出来（空文件 / 编码不认识 / 读取失败），本维度不参与计分。" = "%1$@ log files were listed but not one line could be read (empty, unknown encoding, or read failure), so this dimension is not scored.";
"崩溃通道读到 %1$@ 份报告、确认 %2$@ 次崩溃，但一行真日志都没有 ⇒ 错误密度没有分母，本维度不参与计分（这也不等于「零错误」）。" = "The crash channel yielded %1$@ reports and %2$@ confirmed crashes, but not a single real log line, so error density has no denominator and this dimension is not scored (which is also not \\\"zero errors\\\").";
"%1$@ 份崩溃报告没能读出来，崩溃证据不确定，本维度不参与计分。" = "%1$@ crash reports could not be read, so the crash evidence is uncertain and this dimension is not scored.";

// 批次 P62（词汇层）：枚举档名进文案一律先查表，模板不再吃 `\(x.rawValue)`。
"尚未分析%1$@" = "Not analysed yet: %1$@";
"已完成扫描，未发现%1$@" = "The scan finished without finding any %1$@";
"无法分析：%1$@" = "Cannot analyse: %1$@";

// 批次 P63（性能页图例与轴口径、进程组空态三句话、错误日志密度脚注）。
"可信点不够画曲线（%1$@/%2$@）" = "Not enough trusted points to plot a curve (%1$@/%2$@)";
"横轴 %1$@ · 纵轴 CPU %2$@%% / 内存 %3$@%% · %4$@" = "X axis %1$@ · Y axis CPU %2$@%% / memory %3$@%% · %4$@";
"轴不是 0 起点" = "the axes do not start at 0";
"两张图均为 0 起点" = "both charts start at 0";
"内存曲线已剔除 %1$@ 个无证据读数" = "The memory curve dropped %1$@ evidence-free readings";
"距今秒数" = "seconds ago";
"每 %1$@ 秒一格" = "one grid line every %1$@ s";
"横轴：窗口不足 %1$@ 秒（或少于 8 个点）时改标距今秒数——绝对时钟在这个尺度上没有区分度；否则每格步长从固定档位里选，不按点数现算，免得点数一变整个时间轴就重排。带下限的轴是为看清走势而收窄的，不是 0 起点：内存长期在九成是 macOS 的常态，0…100 的域里 93→97 的波动只够画 4pt，肉眼看是一条直线，所以峰值过 %2$@%% 收到 50…100、过 %3$@%% 收到 75…100。" = "X axis: when the window is shorter than %1$@ seconds (or fewer than 8 points) it switches to seconds-ago labels - an absolute clock has no resolution at that scale. Otherwise the step comes from a fixed ladder rather than the point count, so a change in points cannot re-flow the whole axis. A floored axis is narrowed to show the trend, not because 0 is the origin: memory sitting near ninety percent is normal on macOS, and in a 0-100 domain a 93->97 swing draws only 4pt, i.e. a flat line to the eye - so above %2$@%% the domain narrows to 50...100, and above %3$@%% to 75...100.";
"内存在用率曲线，%1$@ 个可信点，当前 %2$@，纵轴 %3$@" = "Memory usage curve, %1$@ trusted points, now %2$@, Y axis %3$@";
"%1$@ 秒" = "%1$@ s";
"首个样本到达后才按匹配模式统计，不预先给出估算值。" = "Counts by match pattern begin only after the first sample arrives; no estimate is offered beforehand.";
"保持「继续」状态，下一帧（约 %1$@后）会立即出数。" = "Keep it on \\\"Resume\\\"; the next frame (in about %1$@) produces values immediately.";
"暂停期间不再查找进程，这里显示的是最后一次采集的结果：全系统 %1$@ 个进程里没有命中「%2$@」。" = "While paused no process lookup runs, so this is the last collected result: none of the %1$@ system processes matched \\\"%2$@\\\".";
"点页面右上角「继续」恢复采样，再判断服务是否真的没在跑。" = "Press \\\"Resume\\\" at the top right to resume sampling before concluding the service is not running.";
"全系统 %1$@ 个进程里没有任何条目命中「%2$@」，因此没有 CPU / 内存 / 线程 / 打开文件数值可显示。" = "None of the %1$@ system processes matched \\\"%2$@\\\", so there is no CPU / memory / thread / open-file value to show.";
"确认该服务已启动，或在「匹配模式」里把规则改宽一点（例如从 mysqld 改成 mysql）。" = "Confirm the service is running, or widen the match pattern slightly (for example mysqld -> mysql).";
"占全机 %1$@" = "%1$@ of the whole machine";
"差分帧未到，不给百分比" = "No differential frame yet, so no percentage is given";
"单进程峰值 %1$@" = "Single-process peak %1$@";
"无成员进程" = "No member processes";
"%1$@/%2$@ 个进程取到" = "%1$@/%2$@ processes read";
"按代码规模归一：每千行 %1$@ 次" = "Normalised by code size: %1$@ per 1,000 lines";
"今日错误按代码规模归一为每千行 %1$@ 次；分母来自同一次扫描的有效代码行。" = "Today's errors normalise to %1$@ per 1,000 lines; the denominator is the effective code lines from the same scan.";
"扫描 %1$@ 行 · %2$@ 个文件" = "Scanned %1$@ lines · %2$@ files";
" · 已跳过 %1$@ 份读取失败" = " · %1$@ unreadable files skipped";
"已跳过 %1$@ 份读取失败，原因分布：%2$@。" = "%1$@ unreadable files were skipped; reason breakdown: %2$@.";
"占扫描行 %1$@" = "%1$@ of scanned lines";
"未记录原因" = "reason not recorded";
"已完成扫描：%1$@ 个文件里没有 TODO / FIXME 标记。" = "Scan complete: no TODO / FIXME markers across %1$@ files.";
"FIXME %1$@ 处通常表示已知缺陷，建议优先在对应文件里核对。" = "The %1$@ FIXME markers usually flag known defects — start with the files that hold them.";
"共 %1$@ 个，已全部展示。" = "All %1$@ are shown.";
"行数是单文件总行数（含空行与注释）" = "Line counts are per-file totals, blank lines and comments included.";
"这一格是代码行，不含空行与注释；总行数（含两者）在「代码规模」页的头条。" = "This figure counts code lines only, excluding blank lines and comments; the total line count (both included) is the headline on Code Size.";
"共 %1$@ 项，已全部展示。" = "All %1$@ entries are shown.";
"当前展示 %1$@ / %2$@ 项。" = "Showing %1$@ of %2$@ entries.";
"当前展示 %1$@ / %2$@ 项 · 按名称排序。" = "Showing %1$@ of %2$@ entries, sorted by name.";
"占依赖总数 %1$@" = "%1$@ of all dependencies";
"已比对版本数据，未发现落后项" = "Version data compared — nothing outdated";
"%1$@（只说明可复现，未计入依赖数）" = "%1$@ (reproducibility only; not counted as a dependency)";
"共 %1$@ 条 · 影响 %2$@ 个依赖" = "%1$@ advisories · affecting %2$@ dependencies";
